    "show_share": true,
    "description": "The Aga Khan University (AKU) is deepening its commitment to literacy and community empowerment by helping to establish a new school library at Twiga Primary School in Dar es Salaam, Tanzania. This initiative reinforces the University's role in promoting literacy and learning at the community level.",
